    "    quietly multilingual",
    "  - a chapter with an externalUrl and pages: 0 — hosted on the publisher's",
    "    own site, so MangaDex serves no images and Quire cannot read it. Hidden",
    "    unless the includeExternal override says otherwise",
    "  - isUnavailable: true, which is a chapter listed but not servable",
    "  - a decimal chapter number (12.5), which must parse",
    "  - no volume on one entry, so the composed title omits the Vol. prefix"
